comments.body:
I think the problem is that the spans doesn't have the operation tag. And the current UI (which is kinda bad) only showing working page when the data get from API has the metrics array for example:

`{
    "name": "service_latencies",
    "type": "GAUGE",
    "help": "0.75th quantile latency, grouped by service",
    "metrics": [
        {
            "labels": [
                {
                    "name": "service_name",
                    "value": "frontend"
                }
            ],
            "metricPoints": [
                {
                    "gaugeValue": {
                        "doubleValue": "NaN"
                    },
                    "timestamp": "2025-08-07T15:08:00Z"
                },`

since the data from groupByOperation api (which operates on specific operation of that service (e.g frontend)) doesn't have this metrics array:
`{
    "name": "service_operation_latencies",
    "type": "GAUGE",
    "help": "0.95th quantile latency, grouped by service \u0026 operation"
}`

Which cause the UI to work like this, (the error can not call for each on labels array (sub element of metrics array)) I think we can forward this problem to UI repository
